{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_31747","headline":"重酬姚少府 · 贾岛","name":"重酬姚少府","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"隙月斜枕旁，讽咏夏贻什。\n如今何时节，虫虺亦已蛰。\n答迟礼涉傲，抱疾思加涩。\n仆本胡爲者，衔肩贡客集。\n茫然九州内，譬如一锥立。\n欺暗少此怀，自明曾沥泣。\n量无趫勇士，诚欲戈矛戢。\n原阁期跻攀，潭舫偶俱入。\n深斋竹木合，毕夕风雨急。\n俸利沐均分，价称烦嘘噏。\n百篇见删罢，一命嗟未及。\n沧浪愚将还，知音激所习。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"贾岛","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_31747.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_31747","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}